# The design system is vendored, not authored here.
#
# Everything listed below is a verbatim copy of the two-design repo (TWO-19).
# tests/Unit/VendoredTokensTest.php asserts these digests on every run, so an edit
# made directly in this repo goes red instead of quietly forking the design system.
#
# That matters beyond tidiness: two-design's CI asserts all 43 colour pairings in
# tokens/two.css against WCAG 2.2 AA. That guarantee only reaches this repo while
# the bytes are identical. Change a hex here and nothing checks it — the site is
# simply less accessible, and every test still passes.
#
# To refresh, follow the README, then run:
#
#   php vendor/bin/pest --filter=Vendored
#
# It prints the digests it wanted. Paste them here in the same commit, and name the
# two-design commit you copied from in the PR body.

